      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "边平行. 磁感应强度$\\vec{B}$与导体$AB$垂直，与它的速度的夹角",
        "为$\\alpha$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "磁场对运动的带电粒子的作用力（参阅§121），其大小等",
        "于"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$f=|q|vB\\sin\\alpha$.　(12-5)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个力的方向是沿着导体$AB$的方向. 洛仑兹力(12-5)在路",
        "程$l$上的功是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=f\\cdot l=|q|vBl\\sin\\alpha$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在导体$AB$中的感生电动势是单位正电荷移动的功："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\mathcal{E}_i=\\frac{A}{|q|}=vBl\\sin\\alpha$.　(12-6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个公式对于在匀强磁场中以速度$v$运动的长为$l$的任何导",
        "体都是正确的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在回路的其他导体中电动势等于零，因为它们没有运动.",
        "因此，整个回路$ABCD$中的电动势等于$\\mathcal{E}_i$(12-6)，如果运动",
        "的速度$v$是恒定的，则电动势保持不变. 此时电流增大，因为",
        "在导体$AB$向右移动时回路的总电阻减小."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "另一方面，利用电磁感应定律(12-4)也可以计算出感生"
      ]
